<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TEDxGIIS Youth</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,100..1000;1,9..40,100..1000&family=Inter:ital,opsz,wght@0,14..32,100..900;1,14..32,100..900&display=swap');
        body, html{
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
            color:#ffffff;
            background-color:#000000;
            font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight:400;
            line-height:1.6;
            letter-spacing:0.3px;
        }
        h1, h2, h3{
            font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
            font-weight:700;
            letter-spacing:0.5px;
            margin:0;
        }
        h1{
            font-size:clamp(2.2em, 5.4vw, 3.8em);
            line-height:1;
        }
        h2{
            font-size:clamp(1.65em, 3.2vw, 2.8em);
            line-height:1;
            margin:0;
        }
        p{
            font-size:clamp(1.06em, 1.35vw, 1.2em);
            font-weight:400;
            letter-spacing:0.2px;
            line-height:1.2;
        
        }
        .nav{
            background-color:#00000085;
            backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            width:100%;
            height:3.4em;
            display: flex;
            align-items:center;
            border-radius:0 0 1em 1em;
            font-size:clamp(0.98em, 1.2vw, 1.08em);
            font-weight:600;
            padding-right:1.5em;
            box-sizing:border-box;
            position:fixed;
            top:0;
            z-index:100;
        }

        #logopng{
            height:3em;
        }
        .ciclk{
            color:#ffffff;
            text-decoration:none;
            height:auto;
            display:inline-flex;
            align-items:center;
            padding:0.75rem 1.25rem;
            box-sizing:border-box;
            position:relative;
            font-weight:600;
            font-size:inherit;
            letter-spacing:0.4px;
            transition:color 180ms ease;
        }
        .ciclk:focus-visible{
            outline:2px solid #EB0028;
            outline-offset:2px;
        }

        .ciclk::before{
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            top: 0;
            height: 5px;
            background: transparent;
            transform-origin: left;
            transform: scaleX(0);
            transition: transform 180ms ease, background-color 180ms ease;
        }

        .ciclk:hover::before{
            background: #EB0028;
            transform: scaleX(1);
        }
        .nav-right{
            margin-left:auto;
            display:flex;
            gap:0.5rem;
            align-items:center;
        }
        .content{
            padding:0.9em;
            box-sizing:border-box;
            display:flex;
            flex-direction:column;
            margin-top:4.8em;
            max-width:980px;
            gap:1.8em;
        }
        
        .hero{
            box-sizing:border-box;
            display:flex;
            flex-wrap:wrap;
            margin-top:3em;
            width:100%;
            height:100vh;
            background-size:cover;
            background-position:center;
        }

        /* SCROLLBAR styling */
            ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 5px;
            }
            ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #353535;
            }
            ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #EB0028;
            border-radius:5px;
            }
            ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #eb0062;
            }
    </style>

</head>
<body>
    <div class="nav">
        <div class="nav-right">
            <a href="/" class="ciclk">Home</a>
            <a href="/speakers" class="ciclk">Speakers</a>
            <a href="/team" class="ciclk">Team</a>
            <a href="/account" class="ciclk"><%= locals.user ? locals.user.name : 'Account' %></a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero">

    </div>
    <div class="content">
        


        <h1>What is TED<sup>x</sup></h1>
        <p>In the spirit of ideas worth spreading, TED has created a program called TEDx, where the x stands for independently organized TED event. TEDx is a program of local, self-organized events that bring people together to share a TED-like experience. Our event is called TEDxYouth@GIISSMARTCampus, since the event is being organized by students of the GIIS Smart Campus . At our TEDxYouth@GIISSMARTCampus event, TED Talks video and live speakers will combine to spark deep discussion and connection in a small group. The TED Conference provides general guidance for the TEDx program, but individual TEDx events, including ours, are self-organized.</p>
        
        <h1>About TED</h1>
        <p>TED is a nonprofit organization devoted to Ideas Worth Spreading. Started as a four-day conference in California 30 years ago, TED has grown to support its mission with multiple initiatives. The two annual TED Conferences invite the world’s leading thinkers and doers to speak for 18 minutes or less. Many of these talks are then made available, free, at TED.com. TED speakers have included Bill Gates, Jane Goodall, Elizabeth Gilbert, Sir Richard Branson, Nandan Nilekani, Philippe Starck, Ngozi Okonjo-Iweala, Sal Khan and Daniel Kahneman.
        <br>
        <br>
        The annual TED Conference takes place each spring in Vancouver, British Columbia. TED’s media initiatives include TED.com, where new TED Talks are posted daily; TED Translators, which provides subtitles and interactive transcripts as well as translations from volunteers worldwide; the educational initiative TED-Ed. TED has established The Audacious Project that takes a collaborative approach to funding ideas with the potential to create change at thrilling scale; TEDx, which supports individuals or groups in hosting local, self- organized TED-style events around the world, and the TED Fellows program, helping world-changing innovators from around the globe to amplify the impact of their remarkable projects and activities.</p>
    </div>

